  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879406",
      "title": "Beyond Entering: Route Leave Guards",
      "lectureOrder": 188,
      "videoOrder": 164,
      "sourceHash": "281b118280aa28a3ef6760307748d845b1957d107406ceadc97b893095b76075",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 5.49,
          "en": "Now these are the guards related to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.49,
          "end": 6.81,
          "en": "coming to a page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.81,
          "end": 10.7,
          "en": "which are called before and navigation action is confirmed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.7,
          "end": 12.34,
          "en": "There also is a useful guard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.34,
          "end": 15.7,
          "en": "which is triggered when the user wants to leave a page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.7,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "Of course, when you leave a page and go to a number of page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 20.8,
          "en": "all \"the before guards\" are triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.8,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "but maybe you also want to run some code on the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.34,
          "end": 30.03,
          "en": "that is being left right before it's being left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.03,
          "end": 33.157,
          "en": "And you possibly want to be able to deny",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.157,
          "end": 36.197,
          "en": "\"the leave this page actioned here.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.197,
          "end": 37.593,
          "en": "But what do I mean by that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.45,
          "end": 40.65,
          "en": "Let's say on the user's list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.65,
          "end": 43.86,
          "en": "we wanna run code whenever this component is left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.86,
          "end": 45.12,
          "en": "We could do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.12,
          "end": 48.83,
          "en": "with the unmounted lifecycle hook vue knows.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.83,
          "end": 50.86,
          "en": "If I locked this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.86,
          "end": 54.713,
          "en": "this will be executed whenever we leave the user's page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.15,
          "end": 59.69,
          "en": "So if I go to users and I leave to teams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.69,
          "end": 61.99,
          "en": "you see unmounted here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.99,
          "end": 65.95,
          "en": "But the problem is that this runs after the hooks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.95,
          "end": 68.47,
          "en": "so after the navigation has been confirmed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 68.47,
          "end": 72.22,
          "en": "and this gives us no way of canceling the navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.22,
          "end": 75.84,
          "en": "Now why might we want to cancel the navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.84,
          "end": 79.4,
          "en": "from inside the component which we're leaving?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.4,
          "end": 82.17,
          "en": "Well, let's say you had a form in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.17,
          "end": 87.17,
          "en": "and you wanna make sure that until that form has been saved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.58,
          "end": 91.05,
          "en": "you at least wanna warn the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.05,
          "end": 93.77000000000001,
          "en": "that there are unsaved changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.77000000000001,
          "end": 97.22,
          "en": "which would be lost if the page is left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.22,
          "end": 100.07,
          "en": "And we can simulate this with a number button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.07,
          "end": 104.78,
          "en": "save changes and a new data property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.78,
          "end": 108.273,
          "en": "so for that I'm adding data to this user's list component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.18,
          "end": 112.94,
          "en": "and there I have to change as saved property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.94,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "which initially is false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 118.25999999999999,
          "en": "And that's of course, just some dummy code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.25999999999999,
          "end": 121.88,
          "en": "Then we could have a method saved changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.88,
          "end": 125.783,
          "en": "and then here I set this changes saved to true,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.95,
          "end": 129.04,
          "en": "and save changes should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.04,
          "end": 130.56,
          "en": "when this button here is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.56,
          "end": 132.54,
          "en": "So let's bind it to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.54,
          "end": 134.85,
          "en": "Again, this is all just some dummy code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.85,
          "end": 136.093,
          "en": "just a small example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.43,
          "end": 141.62,
          "en": "Now we wanna make sure that as long as this is false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.62,
          "end": 143.22,
          "en": "we at least get a warning",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 145.673,
          "en": "that we don't accidentally leave the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.11,
          "end": 149.43,
          "en": "because we all know that you are on that page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.43,
          "end": 151.19,
          "en": "you're entering something in a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.19,
          "end": 154.11,
          "en": "and accidentally we swipe to the right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.11,
          "end": 157.18,
          "en": "and all the input is lost,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.18,
          "end": 160.19,
          "en": "or we accidentally hit the back button on our mouse.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.19,
          "end": 162.4,
          "en": "So accidentally leaving a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.4,
          "end": 164.21,
          "en": "where you entered something in a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.21,
          "end": 166.473,
          "en": "is definitely something we all know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.39,
          "end": 170.78,
          "en": "And that's exactly where another navigation guard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.78,
          "end": 172.22,
          "en": "can help us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.22,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "Inside of a component in the component convict object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 181.057,
          "en": "you can add \"the before route leave guard.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.41,
          "end": 185.13,
          "en": "You can add this if you're using the vue router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.13,
          "end": 187.93,
          "en": "and then the router will call this first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.93,
          "end": 190.7,
          "en": "before calling all \"the before each",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.7,
          "end": 192.507,
          "en": "and before enter guards.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.4,
          "end": 196.59,
          "en": "Now here, you also get to, from and next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.59,
          "end": 200.2,
          "en": "just as on the enter guards,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.2,
          "end": 202.45,
          "en": "but this will now be called first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.45,
          "end": 203.9,
          "en": "And here we can of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.9,
          "end": 208.9,
          "en": "console log, users list component before route leave.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 217.62,
          "en": "And of course, we can also console log to and from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.62,
          "end": 221.2,
          "en": "to see what's inside of these route objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.2,
          "end": 225.66,
          "en": "But most importantly, we can now use next as you learned it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 225.66,
          "end": 230.42000000000002,
          "en": "to confirm the navigation or to only sometimes confirm it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.42000000000002,
          "end": 234.88,
          "en": "For example we can check if this changes saved is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.32,
          "end": 238.41,
          "en": "If that's the case, I wanna call next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 238.41,
          "end": 240.39,
          "en": "because if the changes are saved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 240.39,
          "end": 243.13,
          "en": "the user may just leave the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 243.13,
          "end": 244.88,
          "en": "But if that's not the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.88,
          "end": 246.68,
          "en": "I want to ask the user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.68,
          "end": 249.67,
          "en": "wherever he or she really wants to leave.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249.67,
          "end": 251.63,
          "en": "For that here an else,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 251.63,
          "end": 254.32,
          "en": "we can call the prompt function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 254.32,
          "end": 255.78,
          "en": "which is built into the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.78,
          "end": 257.53,
          "en": "which shows a built in alert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.53,
          "end": 260.31,
          "en": "where the user has to choose yes or no.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.31,
          "end": 261.573,
          "en": "Are you sure?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.87,
          "end": 267.21,
          "en": "You got unsaved changes?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.21,
          "end": 270.21,
          "en": "Is something we could ask here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 270.21,
          "end": 273.68,
          "en": "The result of that is a bullion,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 273.68,
          "end": 278.11,
          "en": "which we could store in a user wants to leave constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 278.11,
          "end": 282.31,
          "en": "And then we call next and pass user wants to leave to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.31,
          "end": 284.40999999999997,
          "en": "And that's either true or false",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.40999999999997,
          "end": 285.96,
          "en": "based on what the user chose",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.96,
          "end": 288.8,
          "en": "and this alert will present to him or her.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 288.8,
          "end": 290.99,
          "en": "And if we pass true to next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.99,
          "end": 294.08,
          "en": "that's just like calling next like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 294.08,
          "end": 296.3,
          "en": "it will confirm the navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 296.3,
          "end": 298.57,
          "en": "If we pass false to next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.57,
          "end": 300.34,
          "en": "this will cancel the navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 300.34,
          "end": 302.463,
          "en": "and the user will stay on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 303.46,
          "end": 305.5,
          "en": "So let me show this to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.5,
          "end": 308.09,
          "en": "If we saved it and I reload users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 308.09,
          "end": 310.74,
          "en": "by default changes are not saved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.74,
          "end": 313.2,
          "en": "this is false by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 313.2,
          "end": 318.2,
          "en": "Hence, if I don't click save changes and I go to teams,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 318.2,
          "end": 321.39,
          "en": "I'm now prompt that wherever I really wanna go,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 321.39,
          "end": 324.84,
          "en": "and prompt was the wrong function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 324.84,
          "end": 326.453,
          "en": "I want to use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 327.31,
          "end": 329.12,
          "en": "confirm, sorry.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 329.12,
          "end": 332.88,
          "en": "So let's use the confirm function and repeat this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 332.88,
          "end": 335.40999999999997,
          "en": "I am on users, I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 335.40999999999997,
          "end": 338.5,
          "en": "changes are not saved and I wanna go to teams.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 338.5,
          "end": 341.42,
          "en": "And now I get this prompt, if I'm sure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 341.42,
          "end": 344.5,
          "en": "and if I click cancel, I stay on users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.5,
          "end": 346.99,
          "en": "The same if I accidentally click the back button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 346.99,
          "end": 348.81,
          "en": "I stay here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 348.81,
          "end": 351.25,
          "en": "If I of course, click okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 351.25,
          "end": 354.883,
          "en": "the navigation is confirmed and I am allowed to leave,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 356.4,
          "end": 358.4,
          "en": "but at least I get those warning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 358.4,
          "end": 361.09,
          "en": "and if I accidentally clicked the back button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 361.09,
          "end": 362.6,
          "en": "or anything like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 362.6,
          "end": 365.44,
          "en": "I don't throw away all my unsaved changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 365.44,
          "end": 368.963,
          "en": "and that can dramatically enhance the user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 369.97,
          "end": 372.22,
          "en": "Of course, if I click save changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 372.22,
          "end": 374.5,
          "en": "I can go without getting the warning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 374.5,
          "end": 378.43,
          "en": "because then changes saved is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 378.43,
          "end": 381.57,
          "en": "And that is why \"the before route leave guard,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 381.57,
          "end": 385.68,
          "en": "can be very useful for enhancing the user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 385.68,
          "end": 388.71,
          "en": "you provide to your users by making sure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 388.71,
          "end": 391.263,
          "en": "that they don't accidentally lose their input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 392.15,
          "end": 395.42,
          "en": "Well, and these are the different navigation guards.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 395.42,
          "end": 397.61,
          "en": "They run at different points of time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 397.61,
          "end": 400.38,
          "en": "and in different places of your code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 400.38,
          "end": 403.88,
          "en": "you can use the place that best fits your requirements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 403.88,
          "end": 406.59000000000003,
          "en": "if you wanna run a guard for every navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 406.59000000000003,
          "end": 408.95,
